# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later OR LGPL-3.0-or-later
# The members (which MCP servers, as which user): /etc/inputloop/omni/members.json (omni-members.example.json beside
# this package's docs is the gw19 shape).  Each member's token: /etc/inputloop/omni/tokens/NAME, from
#   omni-gateway --mint NAME        (prints it once; it goes to the cloud environment's secrets as OMNI_TOKEN_NAME)
# Check the members start and list their tools:  omni-gateway --check
#OMNI_MEMBERS=/etc/inputloop/omni/members.json
#OMNI_TOKENS=/etc/inputloop/omni/tokens
# Loopback only; nginx with TLS in front (nginx-omni.conf.example). Never a public address here.
#OMNI_LISTEN=127.0.0.1:8769
